Package: gloss
Title: Layered, Verifiable Semantics for R Figures
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yonghe", "Xia", email = "xiayh17@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a semantic substrate for an R figure that has already
    been drawn with 'ggplot2', 'patchwork', 'ComplexHeatmap', base graphics
    or 'grid'. Every drawn element is traced to the grob, viewport, panel and
    data row it came from. Agents and people then add layered, append-only
    records anchored to those elements, each checked against the data where
    it makes a claim, and project them to interactive, accessible SVG or
    HTML. The figure's geometry is never redrawn.
